<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>WNG_IratusBug</defName>
    <label>Iratus bug</label>
    <description>A predatory Pegasus-galaxy insect closely tied to Wraith evolution. An Iratus bug lunges for the neck, clamps onto a living victim, and drains life while rapidly regenerating. Pulling at an attached bug is dangerous; controlled medical detachment is the safest known method.</description>
